RT by @FDD: Books that speak the truth and break taboos, sometimes at great cost to the author, are the ones to read— especially in the Arab world. 

We are incredibly proud of our friend, @hahussain, for his latest book, “The Arab Case for Israel” that dismantled the taboos and misinformation about peace in the Middle East.

